\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Rises On BOJ, Fed Rumors \b0\par\par\uc2  By DAVID JOLLY \par \uc2 572 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 1995\par 07:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar rose in Asian dealings Thursday from its levels in New York late Wednesday, supported by rumors that the Federal Reserve was checking rates and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Though Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was never actually confirmed, in keeping with its quiet activity of late, one market source estimated that the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent close to $500 million in support of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Likewise, rumors the Fed called dealers to check rates couldn't be confirmed. If the rumors are correct, dealers said, the Fed was likely giving the market a gentle reminder of its willingness to join with Japanese monetary authorities to support the dollar. \par \par \uc2  At any rate, traders said the dollar appears to have stabilized at current levels for the time being, both as a result of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  talk and buying interest from interbank players. \par \par \uc2  They said the market now will turn its eyes to European dealings, where BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has less effect, and perhaps more importantly, to U.S. stocks and bonds, where a sell-off Wednesday pushed the dollar sharply lower against the mark. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 87.64 yen, above 87.33 yen late Wednesday in New York but down from 87.71 yen late Wednesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.3771 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3758 marks late Wednesday in New York and but below 1.3865 marks in London Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 63.64 yen, up from 63.48 yen in New York late Wednesday and from 63.26 yen in London late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Speaking to AP-Dow Jones, a Bank of Japan official Thursday denied market talk that Japanese financial and monetary authorities have targeted 90.00 yen as the proper short-term dollar level, saying the target is higher. But he didn't divulge what the target is. \par \par \uc2  Most traders said market sentiment for the dollar remains relatively bullish in the medium term, but they said there is now a bit more negative dollar sentiment in the market than just a few days ago, when the dollar was expected to clear the 90.00-yen level within a week or two. \par \par \uc2  Still, traders said that the 90.00 yen level appears within grasp, especially if U.S. securities markets recover. \par \par \uc2  'New York stocks and bond markets are the key,' said Masafumi Kurokawa, manager of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at First National Bank of Chicago. He said that if those markets hold their ground, the dollar should reach 90-92 yen within a month, adding that 'I think we'd have already seen 90.00 yen if U.S. stocks hadn't fallen.' \par \par \uc2  The Dow Jones Industrial Average (DJIA) fell 57.41 points Wednesday in the heaviest trading since the crash of October 1987, ending at 4628.87. \par \par \uc2  Kurokawa estimated the dollar will trade at 87.30-88.10/20 yen and 1.3740-1.3810/20 marks in the remainder of the global day, assuming U.S. stocks hold up. But he said continued weakness in U.S. securities markets could see the dollar as low as 1.3650 marks and 86.80 yen. \par \par \uc2  'But I'm ready to buy (dollars) at those levels,' he said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-07-95 \par \par \uc2  0557GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr7k05fl1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
