\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dollar Mixed After Greenspan \b0\par\par\uc2  By KELLY OLSEN \par \uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 1995\par 07:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--Much-awaited comments by Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan had little effect Wednesday on Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealings, where the dollar is trading mixed compared with its levels late Tuesday in New York. \par \par \uc2  'There was nothing new,' a trader at a continental European bank said regarding the Fed chief's Tuesday night speech and comments to the Economic Club of New York. \par \par \uc2  Greenspan's remarks did, however, cause a rally in prices of U.S. Treasurys in Tokyo on Wednesday after he said, in response to a question, that monetray policy should be taken 'ahead of the curve.' \par \par \uc2  The comment was interpreted as suggesting that a cut in U.S. rates could be in the cards. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers, however, said the dollar was affected little in either direction as range-trading continues amid concern about possible coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and caution ahead of U.S.-\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  auto talks Thursday and Friday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 84.20 yen, below 84.49 yen late Tuesday in New York and down from 84.65 yen late Tuesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.3910 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3905 marks late Tuesday in New York but below 1.3953 marks in London Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 60.53 yen, down from 60.76 yen in New York late Tuesday and below 60.67 yen in London late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-06-95 \par \par \uc2  0535GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr6l04p1n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
