\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Slide Stopped Short By BOJ \b0\par\par\uc2  By DAVID JOLLY \par \uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 1995\par 07:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar was flat versus the yen but up against the Deutsche mark late in Asian dealings Monday compared with levels in New York late Friday, though traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have been considerably lower without \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  arrested a dollar slide early in the Asian day by buying the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continuously around 0001 GMT at levels up to near 82.15 yen. The BOJ's activity triggered some stop-loss dollar-buying by traders who came out of the weekend short dollars. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ was rumored to be in the marketplace again late in the afternoon, buying the dollar around 82.40 yen, and the move again triggered stop-loss buying with the dollar reaching an intraday high of 82.88 yen around 0519 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 82.75 yen, flat from 82.75 yen late Friday in New York but down marginally from 82.79 yen late Friday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.3825 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3770 marks late Friday in New York and above 1.3785 marks in London Friday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 59.82 yen, down from 60.09 yen in New York late Friday but below 60.06 yen in London late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the market is still moving down on a technical retracement, following the failure of dollar bulls to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  above 88.00-yen resistance last week. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-05-95 \par \par \uc2  0538GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr5t03x3k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
