\par\par \b \uc2  U.S. Treasurys In Tokyo Lower; Yield Curve Flattens \b0\par\par\uc2 303 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 1995\par 08:56\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--Prices of U.S. Treasurys in Tokyo are mostly lower as selling was seen from the short end to the middle of the yield curve in light volume. \par \par \uc2  "The curve continues to flatten," says a dealer at a foreign-based securities company. \par \par \uc2  For the past few sessions, buying during the Tokyo morning has supported the market here, but on Friday such purchases didn't materialize. Participants are seen cautious about buying shorter maturities amid talk that central banks may be selling short-term Treasurys as the dollar rebounds. 6 1/2%   2-year     100 17/32   Dn  2/32  6.20% 6 3/4%   5-year     101  8/32   Dn  2/32  6.45 6 1/2%  10-year      98 24/22   Dn  1/32  6.67 7 5/8%  30 1/4-year 107 29/32   Up  2/32  6.99 \par \par \uc2  "For the first time in a long while central banks were moving to sell, and there were rumors overnight that they have sold the short end," says a dealer at another foreign-based securities company. "There was also talk that a European \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was shifting to the long end of the yield curve." \par \par \uc2  Central banks, especially the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , are long dollars after repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a lot of these funds are parked in short-term Treasurys. But now that the dollar is rebounding, and Treasurys are rallying, there is talk that central banks are taking profits. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is trading around 85.95 yen, up from 85.65 yen in New York late Thursday and 83.88 yen in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS 05-12-95 \par \par \uc2  0256EDT \par \par \uc2  4035 4041 4077 4085 4118 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011024dr5c016iq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
