\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr Up Vs Yen On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Fears After G-7: World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By RENA S. MILLER \par \uc2 318 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 1995\par 22:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (AP-DJ)--The dollar rose strongly against the yen Wednesday, as the initial market disappointment with the results of Tuesday's Group of Seven (G-7) meeting was offset by fears of coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar was also helped briefly against the Deutsche mark after a Bundesbank official indicated that German interest rates may have further room to fall - though the dollar later gave up those gains to trend lower against the mark. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's move up against the yen began early in Asian dealings amid rumors that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars around 81.50 yen, in an attempt to reverse the dollar's slide in the immediate aftermath of the G-7 gathering. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was also spurred higher in Asia by rumors that the U.S. Federal Reserve might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well. \par \par \uc2  'Nothing out of the G-7 warrants dollar-buying. But maybe it makes people think twice about going short on the dollar, in case of G-7 coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even if nothing would indicate that,' said Jim Phoenix, vice president of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales at the Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce in New York. \par \par \uc2  G-7 finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors issued a bland communique at the end of their meeting Tuesday in Washington. The officials called for a reversal of recent \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trends but failed to mention any specific action that would achieve that goal. \par \par \uc2  Late in New York, the dollar was quoted at 1.3680 Deutsche marks, down from 1.3708 marks late Tuesday in New York. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also quoted at 83.78 yen, well up from 81.93 yen. Sterling was trading at $1.6160, up from $1.6115. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-04-95 \par \par \uc2  2044GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4q02zrd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
