\par\par \b \uc2  =Major CMR Feature Stories: Fed Watchers Hedge Rate Outlook; Dollar Weakness, Exports And Inflation; Japan's Idle Threat \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 April 1995\par 23:12\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  FED WATCH: After long holding the view that the Federal Reserve will further raise short-term interest rates, a growing number of economists are now hedging their positions. [4043] \par \par \uc2  DOLLAR WEAKNESS: Continued dollar weakness may translate into more U.S. exports going to Western Europe and the Pacific Rim, but it doesn't carry large inflationary threats to the overall U.S. economy. [4255] \par \par \uc2  IDLE THREAT?: Market players are generally dismissing reports that Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  might recommend that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  stop buying Treasurys with the dollars purchased in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . [4272] \par \par \uc2  VETO BLAME: The White House indicated it believes the GOP would get the blame if President Clinton is forced to veto a bill to increase the federal debt ceiling to which Republicans had attached unacceptable laws. [4208] \par \par \uc2  BOJ WATCH: Now that the Bank of Japan has successfully induced a reduction in the short-term prime lending rates of Japan's commercial banks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seen keeping overnight call rates at current levels. [4131] \par \par \uc2  MACABRE ABS: Securitization of a macabre new class of assets - life insurance policies of the terminally ill - is gaining some acceptance in the asset-backed securities market. [4273] \par \par \uc2  PHILIA WATERS: Philadelphia plans to sell $221 million of water and wastewater refunding revenue bonds Thursday, returning to the markets since its GO debt rating was raised from junk status last week. [4256] \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS 04-19-95 \par \par \uc2  1712EDT \par \par \uc2  4004 4012 4020 4021 4035 4070 4077 4085 4128 4140 4145 4160 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011024dr4j01070\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
