\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday: Dlr Flat-Down; Testing Support At 81.70 Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 311 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 April 1995\par 04:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is lower versus the yen and mark, but unchanged versus the pound at midday in Tokyo Tuesday from levels early in the session, but traders are predicting the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could resume its slide if it manages to break below its first support at 81.70 yen. \par \par \uc2  Unconfirmed rumors continue to circulate that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been quietly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the start of Asian dealings Tuesday, but thus far the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't been able to effectively force the dollar higher. \par \par \uc2  Around 0200 GMT, the dollar is trading at 81.78 yen, down from 81.98 yen around 0030 GMT and from 82.05 yen in New York late Monday. The dollar was quoted at 82.07 yen in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.3690 Deutsche marks, lower than 1.3694 marks earlier in Tokyo but above 1.3665 marks late Monday in New York. The dollar was at 1.3839 marks in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is at 59.74 yen, down from 59.86 yen earlier in Tokyo and well below 60.04 yen in New York late Monday. The mark was quoted in Tokyo late Monday at 59.30 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6195, flat from earlier in Tokyo but below $1.6230 in New York late Monday. Sterling was at $1.6085 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said that while it appears speculators have gone aggressively short of the dollar in the expectation that the dollar will fall further Tuesday, BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't been effective in doing much more than keeping the bottom falling out for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0205GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4i02pbv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
