\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup-2:Eyes On BOJ; Malaysia Ringgit Surges \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 April 1995\par 08:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Banque Paribas's Kihara said ahead of the package's release, the market has room to push the dollar modestly higher. \par \par \uc2  'There are still a number of players with short positions in the market,' he said, indicating a positive set of circumstances for the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  should it want to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or lower interest rates. \par \par \uc2  But amid a lack of fresh market incentives, dealers say the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will probably find itself in familiar bands up to the release of the package. \par \par \uc2  And risk for the dollar to fall significantly lower remains. Dealers say a fall through 82.80 yen will probably guarantee speculators a chance to test lower, perhaps even down to postwar lows of 80.18 yen, at which point the market would be inspired purely by technical factors. \par \par \uc2  Meantime, the Malaysian ringgit surged Thursday. Strong commercial demand and unloading of dollars by offshore players pulled the dollar lower against the ringgit, pushing it below formerly solid support lines. \par \par \uc2  Late Thursday, the dollar is changing hands at 2.4635 ringgit, sharply lower than 2.4845 ringgit late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank Negara Malaysia, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was heard checking rates but not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . With the view that Malaysia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will rise further, it's unlikely investors, especially foreigners will back off anytime soon, they added. Most traders now put the dollar's next resistance level at 2.4500-ringgit. After the dollar broke below 2.4700 ringgit, \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0608GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4d02qf8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
