sday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 59.52 yen, unchanged from 59.52 yen around 0001 GMT but below 59.79 yen in New York late Wednesday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Wednesday at 59.40 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5925, down from $1.5940 around 0001 GMT but unchanged from $1.5925 in New York late Wednesday. Sterling was at $1.5892 in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0033GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4d02pay\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
