\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -6: DEM Strength Seen Hitting German GDP Growth \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 April 1995\par 00:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Western German GDP will likely grow by between 2% and 2.5% in 1996, after an expected 2.5% rise this year, the head of a panel of Germany's six leading economic research institutes said. Panel head Heiner Flassbeck said the slight deceleration in the growth rate would come in part because of factors such as the mark's appreciation and high German wage pacts, which constitute a 'burdening of the future.' \par \par \uc2  Deutsche Bundesbank directorate member Edgar Meister said that based on the fundamentals of the U.S. economy, the dollar is undervalued and should strengthen against its German counterpart. Commenting in an interview with AP-Dow Jones on recent joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bundesbank, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the U.S. Federal Reserve to support the dollar, Meister said the action was necessary because of the volatility in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Meister has a vote on the Bundesbank's policy-making \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Council. \par \par \uc2  U.S. Federal Reserve Board Chairman Alan Greenspan stressed that progress made over the past decade in slowing the rate of inflation globally must continue in order to maintain sustainable economic growth. Greenspan also said central banks around the world also must promote safety and soundness at their commercial banks so they can take advantage of financial developments, such as derivatives. \par \par \uc2  Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland President Jerry Jordan suggested that U.S. inflation is under control and that it's possible to have stable inflation over an extended period of time. Speaking Tuesday to the Ohio Valley Economic Roundtable, Jordan also said a stable dollar is essential for prosperity. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-04-95 \par \par \uc2  2201GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4b02ly7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
