vative Party suffered its worst-ever defeat in Scottish local authority elections Thursday, with the party humiliated by the Labor Party. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen the pound is trading at 136.47 yen compared with 137.20 yen in New York late Thursday; it is also at 2.2049 marks, down from 2.2109 marks. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0229GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4702jdz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
