\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Sinks To New Postwar Lows Vs Yen \b0\par\par\uc2  By MARI PFEIFFER \par \uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 1995\par 07:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is sharply lower against the yen late Friday in Asian dealings, breaking new postwar lows almost as rapidly as it is setting them. \par \par \uc2  Around 0515 GMT, the dollar fell to a new postwar low of 83.98 yen. \par \par \uc2  Following the yen's lead, other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region touched record highs, including the Thai baht and the Singapore dollar. The Malaysian ringgit also continued to rise. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in the morning, hoping to keep the dollar above 84.80 yen, a new low it reached shortly after Australasian dealings got under way. \par \par \uc2  Disappointment continues to surround the dollar, dealers say, enough that Japanese exporters came out of the woods to sell the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as did U.S. funds and some other institutional investors. \par \par \uc2  But also kicking the dollar in the tail Friday were comments by BOJ Governor Yasuo Matsushita, who suggested the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't yet prepared to pare its official discount rate, currently at 1.75%. \par \par \uc2  Around 0530 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 84.13 yen, below 85.40 yen late Thursday in New York and 85.45 yen late Thursday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.3681 Deutsche marks, lower than 1.3763 marks late Thursday in New York and 1.3759 marks in London Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 61.49 yen, down from 62.05 yen in New York late Thursday and 62.10 yen in London late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-04-95 \par \par \uc2  0538GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4702ggp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
