\par\par \b \uc2  Japan March Foreign Reserves Show BOJ Troubles: Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2  By MARI PFEIFFER \par \uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 April 1995\par 13:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--Japan's foreign reserves rose a hefty $15.58 billion in March, indicating the Bank of Japan is in an uphill battle to tame the yen's rapid surge. \par \par \uc2  'This means the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost every day, and aggressively, too,' said Masaru Takagi, Chief Economist at Fuji Research Institute. 'But it's also very clear that the results haven't been too good.' \par \par \uc2  Indeed, despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during March - which saw the dollar fall to a postwar lows of 86.23 yen on March 31 - most analysts and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers are calling for the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue strengthening from current levels. \par \par \uc2  Japan's reserves of convertible foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , gold and International Monetary Fund (IMF) special drawing rights (SDRs) in March shot up $15.58 billion from the preceding month to total $141.52 billion, the finance ministry reported Monday. \par \par \uc2  The increase follows February's rise of $2.08 billion from January. \par \par \uc2  Though the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a policy not to comment on why foreign reserves increase or decline in any particular month, it is generally assumed that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is responsible for fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  'I think the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  better change policies, not simply \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but lower interest rates,' Fuji Research's Takagi said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-04-95 \par \par \uc2  1125GMT \par \par \uc2  1141 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4302djl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
