\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -6: U.S. NAPM Data Shows Growth Rate Slowing \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 April 1995\par 00:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The monthly survey by the U.S. National Association of Purchasing Management (NAPM) indicated the rate of growth in the U.S. economy slowed in March, with its national index slipping to 51.4% from 54.5% in February. The decline was sharper than anticipated. \par \par \uc2  Other components of the survey also fell, including a drop to below 50% in the employment index for the month. A reading above 50% indicates an expansion and a reading below 50% indicates a contraction. \par \par \uc2  Japan's top-ranking bureaucrat at the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  pledged to respond strongly and persistently to movements in the stock and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but didn't offer any further specifics on what that response would be. \par \par \uc2  Jiro Saito, speaking to reporters at a regular press conference, said in particular the movements in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets of the past year that have pushed the yen to new postwar highs against the dollar, 'really don't reflect economic fundamentals.' \par \par \uc2  Japan's reserves of convertible foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , gold and International Monetary Fund special drawing rights in March were up $15.58 billion from the preceding month to total $141.52 billion, the finance ministry reported. \par \par \uc2  The rise follows February's rise of $2.08 billion. \par \par \uc2  The finance ministry maintains a policy of not explaining specifically why the level of foreign reserves changes in any month. But market analysts often attribute the rise in part to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, which traders say has been almost a regular occurrence in recent months. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-04-95 \par \par \uc2  2248GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4302cdc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
