\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Falls Back, BOJ Fails To Stir Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2  By MARI PFEIFFER \par \uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 08:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The euphoria that bumped the dollar higher on the back of German rate cuts wore off Friday in Asian dealings, leaving the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower against the yen and the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  Traders spotted some Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  early in the Tokyo morning just below 89.50 yen, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took one last chance at improving the dollar's levels versus the yen before the fiscal year end. \par \par \uc2  For Japanese corporations, especially exporters, the fixing rate is crucial on the last day of the fiscal year as it represents the final exchange rate at which many \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related transactions are determined. March 31 is the last day of Japan's fiscal year. \par \par \uc2  The surprise decision by the Deutsche Bundesbank to cut its key discount and repo rates Thursday also led to increased speculation the BOJ would cut its discount rate. \par \par \uc2  'There was a fair amount of excitement this morning when the market got wind of a (0130 GMT) BOJ press conference,' said a U.S. bank dealer in Singapore. 'But as always, the BOJ disappointed.' \par \par \uc2  Meantime, the Australian dollar rose after the release of fourth quarter gross domestic product (GDP) data. \par \par \uc2  Around 0601 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 89.13 yen, below 89.58 yen late Thursday in New York and 89.55 yen late Thursday in London. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.4080 Deutsche marks, lower than 1.4090 marks late Thursday in New York and 1.4112 marks in London Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 63.30 yen, down from 63.58 yen in New York late Thursday and 63.46 yen in London late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 31-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0604GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3v02a6b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
