\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ -3: Unsecured Overnight Call Now Matches Discount Rate \b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 04:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Japan said that while the economy continues to head toward recovery, the tempo of that pickup has become more gradual. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cited the stronger yen, as well as movements in bond and stock markets, for raising uncertainty about the economy's outlook. \par \par \uc2  The yen weakened against the dollar Thursday after the Deutsche Bundesbank's decision to lower its discount rate by 0.5 percentage point to 4.00% helped bolster the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But the yen hasn't yet weakened substantially, and despite dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has remained around 89.25-.35 yen in Tokyo early Friday. \par \par \uc2  Short-term money market rates plummeted just after the Bank of Japan announced that it would release the statement. The key unsecured overnight call rate has sunk to 1 24/32% - the same level as the Bank of Japan's official discount rate - from 2 14/32% just before the announcement. \par \par \uc2  The discount rate is the Bank of Japan's charge on loans to banks. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Japan's statement also noted that prices remain stable. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0218GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3v029og\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
