\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Mixed; BOJ Buying, Mkt Watching FOMC \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 02:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is mixed in early Tokyo trading Tuesday from its levels late in New York Monday, with dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  helping to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said they don't expect the market to move much ahead of a meeting of the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) in Washington later Tuesday and a meeting of the Deutsche Bundesbank's central council on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Though market players say they don't expect either \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to change interest rates, broad hints that Japan may cut its interest rates to boost the dollar by Finance Minister Masayoshi Takemura Monday has added some uncertainty to the picture, they say. \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT, the dollar is trading at 89.58 yen, up from 89.50 yen around 0001 GMT and 89.45 yen in New York late Monday. The dollar was quoted at 88.73 yen late in Tokyo Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.4049 Deutsche marks, lower than 1.4065 marks around 0001 GMT and 1.4063 marks late Monday in New York. The dollar was at 1.4135 marks in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 63.76 yen, up from 63.33 yen around 0001 GMT but below 63.61 yen in New York late Monday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Monday at 62.77 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5975, up from $1.5970 around 0001 GMT and above $1.5960 in New York late Monday. Sterling was at $1.5943 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS