\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Up From New York, But Seen Weakening \b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 01:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is higher in early Tokyo trading Friday than its levels late in New York Thursday, after heavy dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  beginning around 2300 GMT Thursday (early Friday in Tokyo) lifted the dollar as high as 88.78 yen. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to a new record low of 88.00 yen in New York Thursday. \par \par \uc2  But traders say it is likely only a matter of time before the dollar resumes its slide against the yen, as there is little apparent support for the dollar below its current levels outside of the dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Early Friday, a BOJ official told AP-Dow Jones the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will 'do its best' in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, and said dollar-bearish market players 'will get their fingers burned.' \par \par \uc2  The official also said talk of Japanese institutions repatriating funds into yen ahead of the March 31 fiscal year-end is 'groundless.' \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT, the dollar is trading at 88.60 yen, flat from around 0001 GMT but above 88.15 yen in New York late Thursday. The dollar was quoted at 88.66 yen late in Tokyo Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.4055 Deutsche marks, also flat from around 0001 GMT and above 1.4033 marks late Thursday in New York. The dollar was at 1.4005 marks in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 63.04 yen, unchanged from 0001 GMT but well above 62.82 yen in New York late Thursday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Thursday at 63.31 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5915, down from $1.5925 around 0001 GMT and well below 1.5955 in New York late Thursday. Sterling was at $1.5868 in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0032GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3o027z3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
