\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Falls But Stays Above New Postwar Lows \b0\par\par\uc2  By MARI PFEIFFER \par \uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 07:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is lower against most of its major counterparts late Wednesday in Asia, despite Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and amid a lack of sufficient factors to help bolster the beleaguered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said the BOJ bought dollars early in Asian-Pacific dealings, below 89.00 yen in attempts to halt it from nearing its newly recorded postwar low of 88.38 yen. \par \par \uc2  'We saw some BOJ buying this morning, but it wasn't a big deal,' said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was once again on the defensive Wednesday, expressing alarm in response to market rumors of an internal report the BOJ is prepared to tolerate a dollar between 78-82.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  A BOJ official said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 'extremely astounded' with the Tuesday rumor which he called 'groundless, ridiculous and silly.' The rumor was also officially denied Tuesday by a BOJ official in New York. \par \par \uc2  Despite the denials, the dollar remained under selling pressure as Japanese exporters continue to take last-minute chances to repatriate funds ahead of the fiscal year end, March 31. \par \par \uc2  Meantime, other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Asian region traded in familiar bands, waiting for stronger directional clues from the dollar and its moves against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0600 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 89.01 yen, below 89.21 yen late Tuesday in New York and 89.35 yen late Tuesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.4117 Deutsche marks, lower than 1.4123 marks late Tuesday in New York and 1.4165 marks in London Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 63.05 yen, down from 63.17 yen in New York late Tuesday and 63.07 yen in London late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0607GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3m021u5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
