\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup: Dlr Hits New Postwar Lows Vs Yen, Recovers \b0\par\par\uc2  By MARI PFEIFFER \par \uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 07:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar barely escaped the clutches of dollar bears in Asia Monday, falling first to new postwar lows versus the yen, then recovering after receiving a strong dose of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and short-covering. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  displayed an unwillingness to allow the dollar to fall further than its new postwar low of 88.65 yen, reached around 0001 GMT. Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively at various levels, and possibly throughout the Asian morning. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said the Bank of Japan itervened between 89.30-.50 yen again in early afternoon trading. \par \par \uc2  Despite new lows reached against the yen, traders said the market was led Monday by dollar-mark transactions. Rumors that Asian central banks were buying back dollars after selling them vigorously generated short-covering across the board. \par \par \uc2  Meantime, the New Zealand dollar (NZ$) crumbled under the weight of its weaker neighbor, the Australian dollar (A$). The Philippine peso, however, was steady, as were the Singapore dollar and the Malaysian ringgit. \par \par \uc2  Around 0600 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 89.46 yen, above 89.10 yen late Friday in New York and 89.20 yen late Friday in London. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.3924 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3860 marks late Friday in New York and 1.3860 marks in London Friday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 64.25 yen, down from 64.29 yen in New York late Friday and 64.38 yen in London late Friday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0605GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3k01ypt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
