\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dollar Lower; Market Still Watching BOJ \b0\par\par\uc2 333 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 01:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is lower in early Tokyo trading Wednesday than its levels late in New York Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  A trader at a foreign bank said he is expecting a quiet day of range-trading Wednesday. He added, however, that the market is still sensitive to any possible dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ). \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the BOJ will definitely come into the market to buy dollars if the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is sold below 90.00 yen but added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could even try to influence trading around current levels. \par \par \uc2  The trader said that the dollar is likely to change hands between 90.60-91.50 yen in Asian time Wednesday with any rallies above 91.00 yen sure to be driven back down by expected Japanese exporters' dollar sales. \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT, the dollar is trading at 90.74 yen, down marginally from 90.75 yen around 0001 GMT and below 90.85 yen in New York late Tuesday. The dollar was quoted at 90.89 yen late in Tokyo Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.4135 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.4131 marks around 0001 GMT but below 1.4165 marks late Tuesday in New York. The dollar was at 1.4095 marks in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 64.20 yen, down slightly from 64.22 yen around 0001 GMT but above 64.14 yen in New York late Tuesday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Tuesday at 64.48 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.5870, up from $1.5853 around 0001 GMT and above $1.5845 in New York late Tuesday. Sterling was at $1.5885 in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The trader also said the market is currently focused on interest rates and will be closely watching Thursday's Deutsche Bundesbank policy-setting council meeting. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0029GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3f01w57\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
