\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Roundup:Yen,DEM,Dn On Profit-Taking;Dlr Rebounds \b0\par\par\uc2  By MARI PFEIFFER \par \uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 07:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--Profit-taking by U.S. and Swiss funds in the Deutsche mark and the yen helped lift the dollar in Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading Thursday, and dealers say a break above key resistance levels may help the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pocket further gains. \par \par \uc2  Some traders said rumors of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  around 90.65 yen - though in lesser amounts compared with recent days - also helped bolster the dollar. \par \par \uc2  But the bulk of the day's gains were made by major players reversing their positions ahead of the Friday release of U.S. non-farm payrolls data, which could give market analysts a better idea of the direction of U.S. interest rates. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar's rapid fall was overdone,' said Hirokazu Note, Chief Dealer at Sumitomo Bank in Tokyo. 'And (U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan) Greenspan's comments Wednesday gave people a reason to start buying it back.' \par \par \uc2  As the dollar rose, it took with it the Australian dollar, which managed to break above $0.7400. But the New Zealand dollar wasn't as fortunate, falling despite its neighbor's stronger tone. \par \par \uc2  While the dollar's rebound spelled relief for some market players, it fast became a headache for others. The Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $5 million in Manila to slow the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's surge against the peso. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was also significantly stronger against the Thai baht, rising beyond the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's posted dollar selling rate of 24.77 Thai baht. \par \par \uc2  Around 0603 GMT, the dollar is quoted at 91.60 yen, above 91.33 yen late Wednesday in New York and from 91.20 yen late Wednesday in London. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also is at 1.4014 Deutsche marks, higher than 1.3935 marks late Wednesday in New York and 1.3925 marks in London Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at 65.36 yen, down from 65.54 yen in New York late Wednesday and 65.49 yen in London late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0608GMT \par \par \uc2  (Corrected 01:25 ET) \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3901o3v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
