\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Up From New York; Traders Watch BOJ \b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 01:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-DJ)--The dollar is higher in early Tokyo trading Wednesday than its levels late in New York Tuesday but is down against the yen and Deutsche mark from its levels about 30 minutes ago. \par \par \uc2  Traders described Wednesday's Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as taking a largely 'wait and see' attitude toward the dollar after its steep fall overseas Tuesday, with special attention on possible dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ). \par \par \uc2  One trader said the BOJ was rumored to have bought the dollar at 90.50 yen but other traders said they doubted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been in the market yet. \par \par \uc2  A trader at a U.S. bank said he expects the BOJ to defend the dollar around 90.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT, the dollar is trading at 90.45 yen, down sharply from 90.80 yen around 0001 GMT but above 90.05 yen in New York late Tuesday. The dollar was quoted at 92.64 yen late in Tokyo Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at 1.3745 marks, lower than 1.3764 marks around 0001 GMT but above 1.3702 marks late Tuesday in New York. The dollar was at 1.4017 marks in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark is trading at 65.81 yen, down from 65.97 yen around 0001 GMT but above 65.72 yen in New York late Tuesday. The mark was quoted late in Tokyo Tuesday at 66.09 yen. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6380, marginally down from $1.6381 around 0001 GMT and below $1.6408 in New York late Tuesday. Sterling was at $1.6258 in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0030GMT \par \par \uc2  1046 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3801nop\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
